+# Butler configuration before the workbench (tree | chat | canvas)
+
+`ButlerBuiltIn-prewb.json` was generated by executing the Swift factory
+`PersonalCopilotConfigurationFactory.configuration(for: PersonalChatHubContract.endpoint)`
+from CellScaffold commit `5e8feb1ca9f26bfb6e0b5ef887e492653e0c8666` (branch `pdd/skjelett-elementer-web`)
+against CellProtocol `1b92d01a030bac424e5172c875753a1dcfe41752`, on 2026-09-19, by a temporary capture
+test in `HAVEN-Deploy/_handoff/WP-R/wp-b5.sh` that is not shipped.
+
+Two factory invocations produced the same canonical skeleton digest. The
+`.json.sha256` companion holds that canonical **skeleton** digest (same
+canonicalization as `ButlerBuiltIn-b4a2779a`), not a checksum of the file.
+Saved copies of exactly this layout are upgraded to the current built-in
+skeleton by `ButlerBuiltInConfigurationUpgrade`.
